<title>FRANCE: Eramet board meeting postponed to July.</title>
<headline>Eramet board meeting postponed to July.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French nickel mining group Eramet said on Monday that a board meeting scheduled for June 24 had been postponed to the second week of July.</p>
<p>It also said that its annual general meeting would take place around the end of July. The company made the two announcements in a statement which gave no further information.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
